<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Thursday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			    3-mths	   6-mths	   1-year</p>
<p>Bank of America	11.70 /11.50  12.10 /11.90   12.60 /12.40</p>
<p>Citibank		 11.80 /11.70  11.95 /11.85   12.30 /12.20</p>
<p>Metrobank		11.70 /11.55  11.90 /11.775  12.50 /12.30</p>
<p>Multinational	  11.75 /11.50  11.925/11.70   12.50 /12.10</p>
<p>PNB			11.55 /11.475 11.925/11.80   12.15 /12.05</p>
<p>Standard Chartered   11.625/11.525 11.80 /11.70   12.10 /11.90</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>* To contribute to this page, please fax your quotes to Reuters Manila newsroom on (632) 817 6267. For details, please phone (632) 841 8934</p>
